nats

This plugin was ported from the kaustavdm/nats-skill project and adapted for the gopher-skills
marketplace (Claude-compatible SKILL.md frontmatter; added .claude-plugin/plugin.json and
package.json). The upstream content is licensed under MIT.

Upstream source:
  kaustavdm/nats-skill — skills/nats
  https://github.com/kaustavdm/nats-skill/tree/main/skills/nats

Files ported/adapted from this source:
  skills/nats/SKILL.md                  (frontmatter adapted to Claude Code shape; body verbatim)
  skills/nats/references/jetstream.md   (ported verbatim)
  skills/nats/references/security.md    (ported verbatim)
  skills/nats/references/server-deployment.md  (ported verbatim)

Considered but intentionally NOT ported:
  nats-io/nats.go CLAUDE.md  — the official Go client's contributor guide (dual-module build/test
                               commands). It is contributor-facing and the skill above already
                               covers application development; including it would add stale
                               build/CI instructions of no value to plugin consumers.

Optional companion (not bundled):
  jesseobrien/nats-mcp (MIT) — a Go MCP server exposing 42 NATS tools (core, JetStream, KV,
  object store). If installed and configured, it pairs naturally with this skill for live
  operations; this plugin ships only guidance, not the MCP runtime.

